# ---- Game dumps: copyrighted, huge, NEVER commit ----
# Any PS5 title dump at the repo root is <TITLEID>-app0. Generic pattern catches every game
# (PPSA24651 = The Messenger / Unity; PPSA17942 = an Unreal Engine 4 title; + any future ones);
# explicit entries kept for clarity.
/*-app0/
/*-app0
/PPSA24651-app0/
/PPSA24651-app0
/PPSA17942-app0/
/PPSA17942-app0
*.prx
*.sprx
*.self
eboot.bin

